  "description": "The game that had been Han Aram’s only refuge as a child: Last Eden. Together with Eve, an NPC who looked just like him, he climbed to the top of the rankings. But when the game shut down, he lost everything. Then, just as he wished the boundary between reality and the game would disappear, Eve appeared before him with an offer:\n\n*\"Let's merge the two worlds... and rule them together.\"\n\n\"Why would I join forces with... myself? I'm already the strongest.\"*\n\nThe world’s top-ranked player from the game, Han Aram, begins tearing apart the real world itself.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
